--- !u!1001 &143716403
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004624, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 0.12433
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004624, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -0.0000071526
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004625, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Cuando el templo despertaba al alba,\nel cuerno saludaba al Sol naciente.\n\nCuando
        la noche ca\xEDa sobre las b\xF3vedas,\nel arpa cantaba bajo la Luna silenciosa.\n\nEn
        las horas m\xE1s oscuras del cielo,\nel tambor marcaba el ritmo de las Estrellas.\n\nY
        cuando la Luna volv\xEDa a alzarse en el firmamento,\nla campana llamaba
        otra vez a los fieles."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004625, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004625, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
      value: 512
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004625, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_HorizontalAlignment
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202876670004627, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202877190041729, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\n\n\n\nLos guardianes del antiguo coro a\xFAn observan este sal\xF3n.\nCada
        uno porta un s\xEDmbolo celestial, pero el tiempo los ha desordenado.\nSolo
        cuando cada m\xFAsico vuelva a portar su signo correcto,\nel mecanismo sagrado
        volver\xE1 a responder.\n\n\nPresiona F para continuar."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202877190041729, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Enabled
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202877190041729, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8543202877190041729, guid: c773b3eab2970fe4d8a631491424b274, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
